{"slug":"n-ss-b","ar":"ن ص ب","total":32,"core":"share; toil; setting up","forms":[{"ar":"نَصِيب","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":21,"gloss":"portion, share","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":202,"p":3,"ar":["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","لَهُمْ","نَصِيبٌ","مِّمَّا","كَسَبُوا۟ ۚ","وَٱللَّهُ","سَرِيعُ","ٱلْحِسَابِ"],"en":"Those will have a share of what they have earned, and Allah is swift in account"}},{"ar":"نَصَب","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"fatigue, weariness","word":null,"ex":{"s":15,"a":48,"p":4,"ar":["لَا","يَمَسُّهُمْ","فِيهَا","نَصَبٌ","وَمَا","هُم","مِّنْهَا","بِمُخْرَجِينَ"],"en":"No fatigue will touch them therein, nor from it will they [ever] be removed"}},{"ar":"نُصُب","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"goal; stone altars","word":null,"ex":{"s":70,"a":43,"p":8,"ar":["يَوْمَ","يَخْرُجُونَ","مِنَ","ٱلْأَجْدَاثِ","سِرَاعًا","كَأَنَّهُمْ","إِلَىٰ","نُصُبٍ","يُوفِضُونَ"],"en":"The Day they will emerge from the graves rapidly as if they were, toward an erected idol, hastening"}},{"ar":"نُصِبَتْ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":2,"gloss":"to set up; to toil","word":null,"ex":{"s":94,"a":7,"p":3,"ar":["فَإِذَا","فَرَغْتَ","فَٱنصَبْ"],"en":"So when you have finished [your duties], then stand up [for worship]"}},{"ar":"نُصْب","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"distress, hardship","word":null,"ex":{"s":38,"a":41,"p":10,"ar":["وَٱذْكُرْ","عَبْدَنَآ","أَيُّوبَ","إِذْ","نَادَىٰ","رَبَّهُۥٓ","أَنِّى","مَسَّنِىَ","ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","بِنُصْبٍ","وَعَذَابٍ"],"en":"And remember Our servant Job, when he called to his Lord, \"Indeed, Satan has touched me with hardship and torment"}},{"ar":"نَّاصِبَة","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"exhausted, weary","word":null,"ex":{"s":88,"a":3,"p":2,"ar":["عَامِلَةٌ","نَّاصِبَةٌ"],"en":"Working [hard] and exhausted"}}],"surahs":[[4,12],[5,2],[88,2],[2,1],[3,1],[6,1],[7,1],[9,1],[11,1],[15,1],[16,1],[18,1],[28,1],[35,1],[38,1],[40,1],[42,1],[70,1],[94,1]]}